  "evidence": "TEXT_F: Pledges focus on mainstream concerns—cleaner hospitals and increased NHS funding with an aim to end waiting lists; school discipline and empowering heads; 5,000 extra police per year, 20,000 more prison places, and zero‑tolerance neighbourhood policing; controlled immigration via an Australian‑style points system and annual limits; lower taxes by cutting £12bn waste and reducing borrowing; accountability and local power. TEXT_C: Emphasises climate policy (85% CO2 cut by 2030, 40% renewables by 2020), replacing VAT with eco‑taxes and introducing road pricing/higher fuel duty; a universal Citizen’s Income and Citizen’s Pension; public ownership of rail and opposition to airport expansion; cutting defence and decommissioning nuclear weapons; extensive constitutional reforms.",
